- android/arm64-v8a: android/app/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/libmatrixd.so
- android/x86_64:    android/app/src/main/jniLibs/x86_64/libmatrixd.so
Not present for armeabi-v7a or x86; those splits ship no Matrix feature.
Modifications: no source modifications; cross-compiled for Android and staged
  under the file name libmatrixd.so, which is the name the supervisor launches.
  The file name does not indicate the implementation — this is Dendrite, not
  Tuwunel and not the Rust stub in rust/matrixd/.
Build script: scripts/build-dendrite-android.sh. That script clones the default
  branch with no revision pin and honours a DENDRITE_REPO override, so it does
  not reproduce the committed binary. Pin a revision before relying on it.

