IMPORTANT NON-VENDORED INTEGRATIONS
===================================

- Nextcloud Server is the selected experimental module target. The version the
  app installs is set by NextcloudInstaller.VERSION; no Nextcloud payload is
  committed to this repository. It is downloaded at build/stage time.
- Tuwunel and Conduit remain alternative Matrix implementations. Neither is
  bundled. The Matrix binary that ships today is Dendrite, recorded above.


